   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0439_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>]plykˈ Y PWN nmywl dʾryk
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>[MN] (ẔK) Y ʿL bwnˈ ẔNH BYRḤ hwrdṭ Y
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>[ŠNṬ] $X-IIII-III lwcyk Y sṭwrʾn
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>(Y) mṭrhdybʾlgwšnsp̄ dh-lwckˈ
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>Y MN YWM-c ʾwhrmẕd prʾc ʿD
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>YWM hwl KRʾ YWM SWSYʾ
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>Y sʾhṭkˈ Y ṭˈcyk K #-IIII
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>X-III-II glṭˈ lyškˈ
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>K #-IIII IIII-III glṭˈ
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>yng K #III III-II
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>glṭˈ lʾd KḤDH
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trl-p1-l12"/>ŠG G-XI ◯
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trl-p1-l13"/>W ʾsp̄sṭˈ II-C
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trl-p1-l14"/>$$$-X glṭˈ
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trl-p1-l15"/>ʿL hwlynˈ YḤBWNṭˈ
               <lb n="16" xml:id="trl-p1-l16"/>W PWN gwkʾdy-mwdlyh
               <lb n="17" xml:id="trl-p1-l17"/>Y dynyṭʾn
               <lb n="18" xml:id="trl-p1-l18"/>p(ʾ)ṭglʾḇ
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trl-p1-l19"/>YNSḆWNtny
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trl-p1-l20"/>[ʾp̄s](p̄)wlṭˈ (?)
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0439_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>]Friyag ī pad Namēwar dārīg
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>[az] (ān) ī ō bun ēn māh Hōrdād ī
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>[sāl] 37 rōzīg ī stōrān
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>(ī) Mihr-ayār-Gušnasp dah-rōzag
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>ī az rōz-iz Ōhrmazd frāz tā
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>rōz Xwar harw rōz asp
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>ī sāxtag ī tāzīg k(abīz)
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>15 gird rahīg
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>k(abīz) 4 7 gird
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>ǰang k(abīz) 3 5
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>gird rāy hammis
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>ǰaw grīw 11 ◯
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/>ud aspast 200
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trc-p1-l14"/>70 gird
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trc-p1-l15"/>ō Xwarin dād
               <lb n="16" xml:id="trc-p1-l16"/>ud pad gugāy-muhrīhā
               <lb n="17" xml:id="trc-p1-l17"/>ī Dēnyadān
               <lb n="18" xml:id="trc-p1-l18"/>pā̆dīrāy
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trc-p1-l19"/>stānēnd
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trc-p1-l20"/>[abes](p)urd (?)
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0439_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Friyag, manager in Namēwar,
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>[from] that which (belongs) to the bun, this month Hōrdād (3rd month) of
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>[the year] 37 concerning the ration of the mounts
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>of Mihr-ayār-Gušnasp for the duration of ten days
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>from the very day Ōhrmazd (1st day) until
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>day Xwar (11th day) for each day (for) one horse,
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>a trained Arabian, 4 kabīz (of barley),
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>15 bundles (of lucerne), (for) the *carriage horse
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>4 kabīz (of barley), 7 bundles (of lucerne),
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>(for) the war-horse 3 kabīz (of barley), 5
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trans-p1-l11"/>bundles (of lucerne), altogether
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trans-p1-l12"/>11 grīw of barley,
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trans-p1-l13"/>and 200-
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trans-p1-l14"/>70 bundles of lucerne
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trans-p1-l15"/>to Xwarin given.
               <lb n="16-17" xml:id="trans-p1-l16-17"/>And with the witnessesˈ seals of Dēnyadān
               <lb n="18-19" xml:id="trans-p1-l18-19"/>for keeping the receipt
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trans-p1-l20"/>[he con](signed it).
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>